# This repo is text only. Normalise everything to LF in the index and in the
# working tree, on every platform.
#
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true gives Windows contributors CRLF working
# copies while CI checks out LF. tests/check-docs.mjs normalises on read so it
# survives either, but keeping the tree consistent is cheaper than defending
# against the difference everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf
